		{"id":"table001","type":"text","text":"# Quantitative Results\n\n| Library Size | WuYa (full) | WuYa w/o SI | Improvement |\n|--------------|-------------|-------------|-------------|\n| 0 cycles     | 65.4%      | 65.4%      | +0.0 pp     |\n| 100 cycles   | 67.8%      | 65.8%      | +2.0 pp     |\n| 200 cycles   | 69.2%      | 66.1%      | +3.1 pp     |\n| 300 cycles   | 69.8%      | 66.4%      | +3.4 pp     |\n| 400 cycles   | 70.1%      | 66.7%      | +3.4 pp     |\n| 500 cycles   | 70.3%      | 66.8%      | +3.5 pp     |\n\nStatistical significance: p < 0.01 (paired t-test)","x":-360,"y":640,"width":540,"height":380,"color":"6"},
